{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, who has taken a job as a special cleaner, goes to his first cleaning site with his seniors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witnessing the scene of a gruesome death, he begins to feel something that he has never felt before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He begins to feel the presence of something he has never felt before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of short stories in 3 parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 endings + several extra endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and mouse controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operation Method</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TAB key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Menu screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/1.png?t=1740138212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/2.png?t=1740138212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/3.png?t=1740138212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains elements of a walking simulator in which you move around the map while checking items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/4.png?t=1740138212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/extras/5.png?t=1740138212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is a fictional story that has nothing to do with any actual incidents or accidents, although it does contain some cruel expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are welcome to distribute the game in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No prior notification is required, but please include the URL of the store page in the summary section of the distribution page.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3137220?t=1740138212","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740138212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740138212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740138212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, who has taken a job as a special cleaner, goes to his first cleaning site with his seniors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witnessing the scene of a gruesome death, he begins to feel something that he has never felt before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He begins to feel the presence of something he has never felt before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of short stories in 3 parts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 endings + several extra endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and mouse controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Operation Method</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TAB key</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Menu screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite